    "title": "Where to find the best sandwiches in the Hub City - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Amy Anderson ,\n1 days ago\nLUBBOCK, Texas — If you are craving a great sandwich here in the Hub City, several spots stand out in flavor, freshness and service.\nWith the help of our viewers, EverythingLubbock.com created a list of the best places to get a sandwich in Lubbock.\nArt display welcomes Japanese Jr Ambassadors to Lubbock Chicken Salad Chick — 5015 Milwaukee Ave Dion’s — 2721 82nd Street; 6410 82nd Street Firehouse Subs — 2510 Marsha Sharp Fwy; 5027 Milwaukee Ave; 9810 Slide Road Honey Glazed Ham — Located at 3424 82nd Street The Honeycomb Pie Shoppe — 3833 50th Street Jason’s Deli — 4001 S Loop 289 Jersey Mike’s Subs — 3711 19th Street; 6319 82nd Street; 11417 Slide Road McAlister’s Deli — 2415 19th Street; 4210 82nd Street; 6810 Milwaukee Ave Newk’s Eatery — 1500 Broadway Potbelly — 2402 9th Street; 6616 Milwaukee Avenue Shotzy’s Bar and Grill — 3300 82nd Street The Sandwich Spot — 5707 4th Street Spanky’s — 811 University Avenue The Tea Room at KK’s — 6409 Indiana Avenue Is there a sandwich shop that was not on the list, email hubcityeats@klbk13.tv.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KLBK | KAMC | EverythingLubbock.com.",
